OL,3,GNEWSAScottish ministers to work with
OL,4,Acouncils on #100 energy payment rollout
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish ministers will work with
OL,7,Fcouncils to ensure a #100 energy
OL,8,Fpayment is passed on to households in
OL,9,FScotland following Chancellor John
OL,10,FHealey's Autumn Budget announcement.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, Healey told a packed
OL,13,FHouse of Commons that about 20 million
OL,14,Fhouseholds in England - in council tax
OL,15,Fbands A to D - would receive #100 this
OL,16,Fwinter, paid directly into bank
OL,17,Faccounts.
OL,19,FThe Labour minister said the payment
OL,20,Fwould "help deal with rising energy
OL,21,Fbills and take the pressure off in the
OL,22,Fcoldest months".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
