OL,3,GNEWSAScottish ministers to work with
OL,4,Acouncils on #100 energy payment rollout
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's deputy first minister and
OL,7,Ffinance secretary, Jenny Gilruth, told
OL,8,FBBC Radio Scotland Breakfast the
OL,9,FScottish government would seek to
OL,10,Freplicate the scheme but it was "not a
OL,11,Fperfect solution".
